SUMMARY:Deadline: Onassis ONX: ONX Seeds 2026\, Soft Circuits for Hard Time
 s (Athens\, hybrid)
DESCRIPTION:ONX Seeds 2026 is a four-month incubation and seed funding prog
 ram run by Onassis ONX\, the Onassis Foundation's platform for art and adv
 anced technologies\, hosted in Athens in a hybrid format under the theme S
 oft Circuits for Hard Times.\n\nOrganisation: Onassis ONX (Onassis Foundat
 ion)\nLocation: Athens\, Greece\, hybrid format. Open to creators from Gre
 ece and internationally\; remote participation for non-Athens teams.\nAwar
 d: EUR 1\,000 to 5\,000 seed funding per project\, set by scope\; up to fo
 ur projects selected. Plus weekly technical\, curatorial and business ment
 oring\, online masterclasses\, studio and equipment access at Onassis Read
 y for Athens-based teams\, and presentation at ONX Exhibition Athens (17 t
 o 21 March 2027) with travel\, accommodation and artwork transport covered
  for non-Athens participants. No application fee.\nDuration: Four-month in
 cubation\, culminating in ONX Exhibition Athens\, 17 to 21 March 2027.\n\n
 More: https://opencalls.onassis.org/onx-seeds-soft-circuits-for-hard-times
 -2?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://opencalls.onassis.org/onx-seeds-soft-circuits-for-hard-times-2?
 utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Athens\, Greece\, hybrid format. Open to creators from Greece and 
 internationally\; remote participation for non-Athens teams.
END:VEVENT
