 C\, console\, mobile or XR platforms.\n\nOrganisation: Creative Europe MED
 IA (European Commission / EACEA)\nLocation: EU Member States\, EEA and cou
 ntries associated to Creative Europe MEDIA. For game and XR production com
 panies established and majority-owned in a MEDIA country.\nAward: Lump-sum
  grant of up to EUR 200\,000 per project\, set at 60 percent of the estima
